<p:notes xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Slide Image Placeholder 1"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1" noRot="1" noChangeAspect="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldImg"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Notes Placeholder 2"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SOURCE KEY</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>A: https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B-GGUF/tree/main (chosen weight file and size).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>B: https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B (original model card); https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B/blob/main/</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>config.json</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t> (architecture).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Cache setting: assumed 16-bit values, 2 bytes each. This is independent of the chosen Q4_K_M weights.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>All arithmetic results are calculated estimates, not measured peak memory.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>DELIVERY</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Use after the Hugging Face screenshot. Click to reveal the calculations.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SPEAKER NARRATION</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Choose a context budget for one conversation. It includes the prompt and generated continuation. For a 32,768-token sequence multiply 147,456 bytes per token by 32,768 to obtain 4,831,838,208 bytes, or 4.83 decimal GB. The same calculation gives approximately 1.21 GB at 8,192 tokens and 9.66 GB at 65,536 tokens. These are KV payload calculations using the assumed two-byte cache values. Qwen documents 32,768 as the native context and validates extension to 131,072 with </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>YaRN</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>, which stands for Yet another </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>RoPE</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t> </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>extensioN</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>. </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>RoPE</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t> means Rotary Position Embedding, a method for representing token positions. </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>YaRN</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t> adjusts positional scaling to support longer sequences. For 64K Qwen recommends factor two. Changing a runtime context setting alone does not establish reliable long-context behavior. Correct model configuration and sufficient memory are separate requirements. At 128K the cache payload would be approximately 19.33 GB. An engine can allocate for its configured capacity instead of only the currently used tokens. Multiple independent active conversations multiply cache needs, while model weights can be shared.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SOURCES</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B#processing-long-texts</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Slide Number Placeholder 3"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldNum" idx="5"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" marR="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l" defTabSz="914400" rtl="0" eaLnBrk="1" fontAlgn="auto" latinLnBrk="0" hangingPunct="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClrTx/><a:buSzTx/><a:buFontTx/><a:buNone/><a:tabLst/><a:defRPr/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr kumimoji="0" sz="1800" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" kern="1200" cap="none" spc="0" normalizeH="0" baseline="0" noProof="0"><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:effectLst/><a:uLnTx/><a:uFillTx/><a:latin typeface="Aptos"/><a:ea typeface="+mn-ea"/><a:cs typeface="+mn-cs"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:notes>